  "data": {
    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Doubles Event Companion",
    "summary": "At the close of either turn, the team that just acted checks scoring first, followed by the other team. For each Secondary Mission whose conditions you first satisfied that turn, you can claim the listed VP. If you claim it for a Tactical Mission, discard that card. Then, on your own turn and only when using Tactical Missions, you may discard any number of active Secondary Missions for a single award of 1 CP if you discard at least one.",
